Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.51,0:00:07.61,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去寻找吧 收集起梦的碎片{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.55,0:00:18.55,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使胸中苦闷 去感受真切的现在吧{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.59,0:00:23.39,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比外表更单纯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.27,0:00:27.13,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是却无法传达
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.00,0:00:34.64,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要说的话 总是藏在口袋里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.34,0:00:41.30,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,充满孩子气的话语 如今已无法开口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.65,0:00:49.42,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽说时间会冲淡一切 我们却无法相互理解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.52,0:00:55.43,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,24小时 一直相信着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.60,0:00:59.26,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.27,0:01:03.93,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使只是俗常的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.21,0:01:10.44,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间总是 微笑着匆匆流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.38,0:01:21.34,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起回忆 还是去追求理想的今天{\fad(0,1025)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.92,0:01:37.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙是为了抑制
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.83,0:01:40.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉的妖怪之血的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.50,0:01:43.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果无法自在的挥动铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.50,0:01:45.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉会再度妖化成妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.23,0:01:49.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无法再忍耐下去的犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.50,0:01:50.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从刀刀斋爷爷得知
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.14,0:01:53.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让铁碎牙变轻的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.01,0:01:58.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是打倒曾经被 犬夜叉的父亲所封印
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.55,0:02:01.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫做龙骨精的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.56,0:02:11.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想打倒苏醒的龙骨精
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.49,0:02:13.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,方法只有一个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.99,0:02:16.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了爆流破别无它法
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.50,0:02:17.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爆流破？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.70,0:02:20.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是铁碎牙的奥义
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.60,0:02:21.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.07,0:02:23.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉别说是风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.21,0:02:26.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连挥动铁碎牙都很吃力了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.44,0:02:29.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更何况是奥义
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.14,0:02:33.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第54话 铁碎牙的奥义 爆流破
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.91,0:02:51.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的臭小子 马上让你解脱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.50,0:03:11.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉没有拿着铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.27,0:03:13.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点醒醒 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.07,0:03:16.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.11,0:03:22.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.48,0:03:29.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这妖气是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.28,0:03:31.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟刚才完全不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.06,0:03:43.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙的血觉醒了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.30,0:03:47.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也好 这样比较有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.37,0:03:52.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好 犬夜叉妖化了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.94,0:03:53.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.95,0:04:01.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.18,0:04:02.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点解除妖化
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.75,0:04:07.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.45,0:04:08.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样妖化
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.66,0:04:11.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用爪子与龙骨精战斗的话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.19,0:04:13.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许能救你的命
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.83,0:04:16.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 铁碎牙…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.53,0:04:22.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙就无法变轻了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.41,0:04:28.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小鬼 少得意忘形了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.93,0:04:50.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.13,0:04:53.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然能将龙骨精的庞大身躯…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.37,0:04:56.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉打败他了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.74,0:04:58.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快撤退吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.51,0:05:00.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.57,0:05:02.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一看就明白了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.74,0:05:03.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉那小子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.08,0:05:06.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用妖怪的姿态战斗着
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.25,0:05:09.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以要丢下他吗 怎么这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.82,0:05:12.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再待在这里的话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.39,0:05:13.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在龙骨精之后
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.82,0:05:16.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许就会攻击我们了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.32,0:05:18.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冥加爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.53,0:05:20.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉少爷反覆的妖化
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.10,0:05:22.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会无法分辨敌我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.90,0:05:25.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 连你也不例外
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.67,0:05:29.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.84,0:05:32.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冥加爷爷 你快逃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.91,0:05:35.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我下去 刀刀斋爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.91,0:05:37.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要留在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.98,0:05:39.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 你…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.61,0:05:41.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这道理我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.78,0:05:43.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.42,0:05:46.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.99,0:05:50.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要我丢下战斗中的犬夜叉逃走
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.92,0:05:52.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我实在做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.70,0:05:57.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你 刀刀斋爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.93,0:05:58.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我下去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.50,0:06:01.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我我我知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.14,0:06:04.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 拿你没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.71,0:06:05.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.94,0:06:06.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉的样子…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.03,0:06:31.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.90,0:06:32.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.60,0:06:34.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明已经妖化了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.24,0:06:36.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是他还是想用铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.04,0:06:41.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道这小子和戈薇说的一样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.35,0:06:50.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实犬夜叉现在正在战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.35,0:06:53.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己的心与 体内流动的妖怪之血
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.05,0:06:56.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这小子正在拼命的战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.36,0:06:59.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 加油啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.20,0:07:08.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶…臭小子竟然得意忘形
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.87,0:07:13.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,游戏到此结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.51,0:07:17.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.09,0:07:27.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.79,0:07:28.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.60,0:07:41.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙的刀鞘？怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.67,0:07:42.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.24,0:07:45.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刀鞘的结界吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.24,0:07:47.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.47,0:07:49.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前和雷兽兄弟战斗时也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.62,0:08:00.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错！铁碎牙的刀鞘
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.12,0:08:03.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,曾经将雷兽兄弟的雷击弹开
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.62,0:08:04.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刀鞘…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.79,0:08:07.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙的刀鞘保护了犬夜叉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.13,0:08:10.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 不过没有第二次了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.40,0:08:12.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刀鞘已经撑不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.00,0:08:16.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为那种东西有用吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.17,0:08:18.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接招吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.01,0:08:19.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.14,0:08:23.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风穴！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.18,0:08:28.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.28,0:08:30.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好惊人的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.27,0:08:46.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉开了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.63,0:08:47.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才真的好险
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.44,0:08:51.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.91,0:08:53.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是稍微改变那妖气的轨道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.67,0:08:55.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就必须耗费这么多的体力
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.28,0:08:57.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,面对这么强的敌人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.64,0:08:59.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉却只能独自一人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.30,0:09:19.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小鬼的妖气正在消失
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.31,0:09:32.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然用那么庞大的身躯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.68,0:09:34.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,压在别人的刀上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.72,0:09:39.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,龙骨精
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.09,0:09:42.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要用这把铁碎牙打倒你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.20,0:09:52.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就凭你那孱弱的模样 与那把钝刀吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.10,0:09:53.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笑死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.23,0:09:55.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.84,0:09:56.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是不用这把铁碎牙战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.00,0:09:58.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就毫无意义了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.34,0:09:59.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.21,0:10:02.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会再手下留情了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.76,0:10:18.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是我的错觉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.76,0:10:21.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙…正在变轻
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.27,0:10:36.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快看！犬夜叉将铁碎牙…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.74,0:10:37.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.51,0:10:42.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,趁现在贯穿龙骨精的心脏
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.16,0:10:50.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愚蠢…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.18,0:11:10.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,命中了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.64,0:11:12.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贯穿了龙骨精的心脏
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.68,0:11:15.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.96,0:11:26.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好轻！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.69,0:11:29.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来沉重的铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.46,0:11:31.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像紧紧吸在手上一样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.83,0:11:35.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然用刀刃将我…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.10,0:11:40.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小鬼 我要宰了你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.85,0:11:49.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还没死啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.36,0:11:56.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好可怕的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.72,0:11:59.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,心脏被贯穿了还没事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.49,0:12:03.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,龙骨精是连犬夜叉的父亲 都感到棘手的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.13,0:12:06.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非粉身碎骨那家伙才会死
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.50,0:12:08.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么这样
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.98,0:12:21.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换我了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.76,0:12:32.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.89,0:12:35.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 身体竟然这么硬
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.40,0:12:40.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我早说过那把钝刀没有用的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.17,0:12:45.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个气息…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.67,0:12:47.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是风之伤的气息
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.68,0:12:55.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤围绕着铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.29,0:13:02.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小鬼 到此为止了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.26,0:13:04.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,龙骨精 我要让你知道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.26,0:13:07.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在的我哪里不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.80,0:13:13.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.18,0:13:25.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.31,0:13:26.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.31,0:13:28.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.55,0:13:29.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打倒了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.96,0:13:46.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙不是只有变轻而已
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.73,0:13:49.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还可以随时施展风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.97,0:13:53.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看见没 刀刀斋
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.61,0:13:55.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我办到了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.58,0:13:58.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到目前为止还值得称赞
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.71,0:14:01.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是要安心还太早了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.48,0:14:03.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.27,0:14:22.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样吗 小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.00,0:14:26.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是太让我失望了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.61,0:14:31.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这点程度就想打倒我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.88,0:14:33.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙怎么搞的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.85,0:14:36.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挨了风之伤依然好端端的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.02,0:14:39.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我就说了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.39,0:14:40.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经说过了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.39,0:14:44.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的身体比钢铁更坚硬
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.26,0:14:47.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 现在换我了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.40,0:14:49.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.03,0:14:51.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先逃离这里再说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.53,0:14:52.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙要来真的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.27,0:14:54.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.17,0:15:02.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙…好惊人的妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.18,0:15:05.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在不是惊叹的时候 快逃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.01,0:15:07.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可不行
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.55,0:15:09.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,龙骨精可是干劲十足
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.92,0:15:12.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之你已经能使用铁碎牙了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.92,0:15:14.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.65,0:15:15.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.19,0:15:17.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少说这么悠哉的话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.16,0:15:20.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直在等待这种时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.31,0:15:33.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.67,0:15:35.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是不解决掉这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.84,0:15:37.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要如何超越老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.81,0:15:41.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.05,0:15:44.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟你父亲一同踏上黄泉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.22,0:15:44.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好大！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.42,0:15:46.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也会被卷进去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.09,0:15:48.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母 快离开这里
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.43,0:16:02.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才的妖气块与这相比
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.74,0:16:04.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,简直小的可怜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.34,0:16:05.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.84,0:16:07.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.98,0:16:11.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要粉碎龙骨精强韧的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.21,0:16:15.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然还是得使出爆流破
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.58,0:16:17.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是现在的犬夜叉…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.39,0:16:19.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,躲不掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.69,0:16:23.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经无处可躲了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.22,0:16:27.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么只有砍过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.52,0:16:45.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才的妖气块与这相比简直小得可怜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.19,0:16:50.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经无处可躲了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.69,0:16:53.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么只有砍过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.47,0:17:05.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.11,0:17:08.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该不会…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.68,0:17:12.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那小子使出了爆流破
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.45,0:17:16.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那股气流
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.98,0:17:17.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要用风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.42,0:17:19.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,扫过那股焦臭味的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.12,0:17:24.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.80,0:17:32.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.97,0:17:34.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这小鬼的刀气
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.80,0:17:37.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然将我的妖气卷进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.25,0:17:52.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么有这种傻事…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.53,0:18:04.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙气流的漩涡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.47,0:18:07.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将龙骨精妖气压回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.34,0:18:19.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能会有这种事的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.85,0:18:26.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的身体…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.79,0:18:29.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我钢铁般的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.31,0:18:52.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.55,0:18:55.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和以前的风之伤完全不同
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.29,0:18:59.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.06,0:19:00.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.72,0:19:02.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.56,0:19:04.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你成功了 好了不起喔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.06,0:19:07.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,龙骨精完全灰飞烟灭了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.57,0:19:09.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.30,0:19:11.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是怎么办到的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.30,0:19:14.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.77,0:19:18.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不愧是犬夜叉少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.21,0:19:21.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有我一直相信你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.05,0:19:25.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冥加爷爷一直撒手不管吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.32,0:19:29.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 刀刀斋你…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.79,0:19:34.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时候你还满灵光的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.89,0:19:37.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在铁碎牙里加了什么机关吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.33,0:19:39.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比之前强太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.60,0:19:44.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还搞不清楚状况吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.40,0:19:49.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才那就是铁碎牙的奥义
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.31,0:19:51.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爆流破
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.51,0:19:54.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爆流…破？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.85,0:19:57.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才的就是爆流破吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.51,0:20:00.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 所谓的爆流破
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.52,0:20:04.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是将对方的妖气卷入风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.19,0:20:06.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再让妖气逆流的必杀剑
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.06,0:20:10.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卷入风之伤 使妖气逆流？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.36,0:20:12.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卷在一起的风之伤与妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.86,0:20:14.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会变成漩涡然后压回来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.37,0:20:18.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敌人会完全承受
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.43,0:20:21.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己的妖气与铁碎牙的威力
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.17,0:20:25.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正就是这种道理
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.54,0:20:28.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽管如此
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.81,0:20:31.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了找出斩断妖气的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.68,0:20:33.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更重要的 若不能发出
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.65,0:20:36.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,足以压倒敌人妖气 的强气的话就不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.45,0:20:38.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很厉害嘛 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.66,0:20:43.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是试着朝 焦臭味的方向砍过去而已
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.16,0:20:47.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然超越了理论
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.46,0:20:50.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这小子也许是 超乎我想象的大人物
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.97,0:20:52.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 总之这样子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.90,0:20:55.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就能自在的操控铁碎牙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.91,0:20:57.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不只是这样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.34,0:20:59.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看了别吓一跳喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.15,0:21:12.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.92,0:21:13.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.79,0:21:16.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随时都能施展风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.26,0:21:24.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如何 轻而易举
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.20,0:21:29.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 别这样 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.47,0:21:31.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么危险的刀
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.11,0:21:33.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可以随便乱挥
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.21,0:21:38.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再也没有人能赢我了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.31,0:21:40.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不甘心的话来阻止我呀
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.45,0:21:41.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.65,0:21:44.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.86,0:21:46.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 像你这种人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.22,0:21:49.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一下子就得意忘形
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.46,0:21:51.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的很单纯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.46,0:21:52.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不振作一点的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.40,0:21:56.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶…被戈薇讨厌了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.17,0:22:02.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然 还不成气候
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.44,0:22:05.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.78,0:22:30.25,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,何不把真正重要的事物以外{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.82,0:22:42.33,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部 都舍弃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.04,0:22:49.74,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现实 往往是如此残酷
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.34,0:22:53.04,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但每当 遇到这种时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.31,0:22:57.27,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只要紧闭双眼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.82,0:23:04.55,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,便能看见 你的笑容{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.56,0:23:12.49,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Ah- 但愿从此以往
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.40,0:23:20.03,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到进入 沉眠的那一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.51,0:23:27.31,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的 那抹笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.88,0:23:35.62,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都绝没有 消逝的瞬间{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.84,0:23:51.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小女孩独自等待着 去打仗后就没有回来的哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.14,0:23:56.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月拥有能够 实现梦想的宝贝 四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.75,0:23:58.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果是真的话 不拿走不行
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.15,0:24:00.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,苦恼的七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.55,0:24:03.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道他喜欢五月吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.12,0:24:04.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个时候
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.09,0:24:06.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以四魂碎片为目标的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.82,0:24:08.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又设下卑鄙的陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.93,0:24:11.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.36,0:24:13.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,石之花与七宝的初恋
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.53,0:24:15.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敬请期待
